stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Accepted does not mean paid
accDescr: An order is durably queued before processing, and idempotency prevents redelivery from creating a second order.
[*] --> Authenticated
Authenticated --> Accepted: Validate order, enqueue in SQS
Accepted: Pending status returned to customer
Accepted --> Processing: Worker receives message
Processing --> Completed: Payment succeeds, persist result
Processing --> Retry: Transient downstream error
Retry --> Processing: Redelivery with same order ID
Processing --> Rejected: Permanent business failure
Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
note right of Processing
Idempotent operations
reuse the order ID
end note
